error[E0105]: modules cannot declare fields
  --> tests/ui/overload_errors.wid:32:3
   |
32 |   greeting: String
   |   ^^^^^^^^ a module only holds methods and constants
help: declare `greeting` in each struct that includes the module; module methods read it with `@greeting`
   = see `wid explain E0105`

error[E0322]: `include` takes a module, but this is a struct
  --> tests/ui/overload_errors.wid:38:11
   |
15 | struct Entity
   |        ------ the struct is declared here
...
38 |   include Entity
   |           ^^^^^^ not a module
help: to reuse a struct's fields and methods, add a `using` field instead
